.TH "GMB" "1" "Sep 2026" "GlassMarble 1.2.0" "GlassMarble Manual"

.SH NAME
gmb-doc-release - Generate a migration guide between two git refs


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgmb doc release \&.. [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Computes the public API breaking changes between two git refs using
AKG symbol diffing and generates a migration guide markdown file.

.PP
The output includes:
  - Deleted exported functions
  - Changed function signatures (before/after)
  - Renamed struct fields or config vars
  - Auto-generated migration code examples


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for release

.PP
\fB--out\fP=""
	Output file path for the migration guide


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--color\fP="auto"
	Color output mode: auto|always|never

.PP
\fB-c\fP, \fB--config\fP=""
	Config file path (default is $HOME/.glassmarble.yaml)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging

.PP
\fB--dir\fP=""
	Target repository directory for analysis and queries

.PP
\fB--max-json-mb\fP=0
	Refuse to load or commit an AKG state file (akg.json) larger than this many MiB (0 = unlimited)

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-error output

.PP
\fB-v\fP, \fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Verbose output logging


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gmb doc release v1.1.0..v1.2.0
  gmb doc release v1.1.0..HEAD --out docs/migrations/v1.1-to-v1.2.md
.EE


